      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Security invariants (ADR-0004, release blockers): docker.sock lives ONLY in the coder container · workspaces hold NO AWS credentials and NO docker CLI · only LiteLLM reaches Bedrock (instance role via IMDSv2, hop limit 1) · postgres published on loopback only (aws mode)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Security invariants (ADR-0004, release blockers): docker.sock lives ONLY in the coder container · workspaces hold NO AWS credentials and NO docker CLI · only LiteLLM reaches Bedrock (instance role via IMDSv2, hop limit 1) · postgres published on loopback only (aws mode)",
